---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Data Deletion — IG AutoDM">
<style>
.legal{padding:48px 0;max-width:800px}
.legal h1{font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-1px;margin-bottom:8px}
.legal h2{font-size:22px;margin:32px 0 12px}
.legal p,.legal li{font-size:15px;margin-bottom:12px}
.legal ol{padding-left:24px}
</style>
<div class="legal"><div class="wrap">
<h1>User Data Deletion</h1>
<p>To delete all data IG AutoDM holds about you:</p>
<ol>
<li>Disconnect your Instagram account from the dashboard (stops all automation immediately).</li>
<li>Email <a href="mailto:ligitg9@gmail.com">ligitg9@gmail.com</a> from your account email with subject <b>“Delete my data”</b>.</li>
<li>We delete your user record, connected Instagram accounts and tokens, configurations, cached media, and logs within <b>30 days</b>, and confirm by email.</li>
</ol>
<h2>What gets deleted</h2>
<p>Login identity, encrypted Meta access tokens, connected account records, reply/DM configurations, and all send logs. Backups expire within the same 30-day window.</p>
</div></div>
</Base>
